            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "笔岛先生，感谢您百忙之中抽空前来。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200080",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哪里哪里，也感谢您的邀请。/n不过，没想到您竟然会邀我来看戏……",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200090",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "每次都只是普通聚餐，对商务合作也没什么新进展。/n所以我想，偶尔换个方式也不错。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200100",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……难道舞台艺术不合笔岛先生的喜好吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200110",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不，并非如此。/n只是我对戏剧并不了解……",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200120",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "既然如此，这正是难得的机会。/n请务必好好欣赏。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200130",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "这家剧团最近很受我关注。/n这是剧场介绍，请。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "您真是周到……嗯？Eden？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200150",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "怎么了吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不，那个……如果不是我记错的话，/n这里应该就是我女儿所属的剧团。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10204200170",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020420019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020420,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "合作方经营者",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什么，原来如此！",
